From add3c013cc103b84ba0441c2bb0bdf2d346c6ddb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Dr. Hutson" <hutsona@umsystem.edu>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:21:30 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(session): surface ActiveStageOutput::ServerRedirect

A Server Redirection PDU received on the I/O channel is now reported as
IoChannelPdu::ServerRedirect, x224::ProcessorOutput::ServerRedirect and
ActiveStageOutput::ServerRedirect instead of failing the session. The
bundled client and web client end the session with a clear reason, since
they do not implement the redirection loop.
